{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26957","headline":"和裴令公游南庄忆白二十韦七二宾客 · 姚合","name":"和裴令公游南庄忆白二十韦七二宾客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四郊初雨歇，高树滴犹残。\n池满红莲湿，云收绿野宽。\n花开半山晓，竹动数村寒。\n鬬雀翻衣袂，惊鱼触钓竿。\n罇前多野客，膝下尽郎官。\n斸石通泉脉，移松出药栏。\n关东分务重，天下似公难。\n半醉思韦白，题诗染彩翰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26957.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26957","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}